B.PW=new A.bv("RangeSlider",null,"A range is two boxes, from and to (CivicTextField): two thumbs on one track are harder still to set exactly")
B.PX=new A.bv("ColorPicker",null,"A public service never asks for a colour it cannot also take in words: a vehicle's colour is typed (CivicTextField)")
B.PY=new A.bv("ActionSheet",null,u.A)
B.PZ=new A.bv("SegmentedButton",null,"One answer of several is a radio group (CivicRadioGroup), whose answers wrap and grow with the text where segments squeeze")
B.Q_=new A.bv("ScrollArea",null,"A service's page scrolls whole, with the platform's own scrollbar: Civic puts nothing that scrolls inside a page, where a reader with a magnifier loses it")
B.Q0=new A.bv("Tooltip",null,"Civic writes an action's name on it; its few glyph-only buttons (CivicIconButton: Close) carry their name for a screen reader, and a tip a finger cannot reach is help some readers never get")
B.Q1=new A.bv("FloatingActionButton",null,"A floating button is Material vocabulary: a page's action is a button where the page ends (CivicButton), after what it acts on")
B.Q2=new A.bv("CircularProgressIndicator",null,"A public service's page loads whole; a wait it cannot avoid is a page that says what is happening, in words")
B.Q3=new A.bv("Calendar",null,"A date the reader knows is typed (CivicDateInput); a date chosen from what is free is a list of radios (CivicRadioGroup), which a screen reader reads as easily as an eye")
B.Q4=new A.bv("TimePicker",null,'A time is typed (CivicTextField, "for example, 2:30pm"), or chosen from the times free as radios (CivicRadioGroup)')
B.Q5=new A.bv("SwipeActions",null,u.A)
B.Q6=new A.bv("Resizable",null,"A public service is one reading column: there are no panes to size")
B.Q7=new A.bv("Media",null,"A public service carries its meaning in words: a picture that a reader needs is a file to open (CivicLink)")
B.Q8=new A.bv("Command",null,"A public service is found by its words, not commands: a search box (CivicSearchField) finds what a reader looks for")
B.Q9=new A.bv("Rating",null,"A public service asks how it went in words a reader picks (CivicRadio: very good to very poor) and a box for why: a row of stars is hard to hear, to reach by the keys and to tap exactly")
B.Qa=new A.bv("BottomSheet",null,u.p)
B.Qb=new A.bv("Avatar",null,"A public service knows a reader by their name and a reference, which it writes out: it shows no faces")
B.Qc=new A.bv("Menu",null,u.A)
B.Qd=new A.bv("WheelPicker",null,"A wheel is a phone's gesture: a date is typed (CivicDateInput) and one answer of several is a radio group (CivicRadioGroup)")
B.Qe=new A.bv("LinearProgressIndicator",null,"A public service's page loads whole and says how far through a service the reader is in words (CivicPageBody's caption)")
B.Qf=new A.bv("HoverCard",null,"A hover is out of reach of a finger, the keys and a screen reader: what more there is to know is in sight or folded (CivicDetails)")
B.Qg=new A.bv("LineChart",null,u.y)
B.Qh=new A.bv("PageDots",null,"Civic has no carousel, so nothing to count: every page of a service is a page")
B.Qi=new A.bv("AvatarGroup",null,"A public service shows no faces, so no pile of them: people are named in a list (CivicSummaryList)")
B.Qj=new A.bv("Sheet",null,u.p)
B.Qk=new A.bv("PieChart",null,u.y)
B.Ql=new A.bv("Slider",null,"A public service asks for an amount in a box sized for it (CivicTextField): a slider is hard to set exactly, by a hand that shakes or by the keys")
B.Qm=new A.bv("Chip",null,"Filters are checkboxes in the filter column (CivicCheckbox), and a status is a tag (CivicTag): chips mix the two")
B.Qn=new A.bv("MultiSelect",null,"Several answers are checkboxes (CivicCheckbox in a CivicFieldset): each answer in sight and in words, where tags in a box hide what was not chosen")
B.Qo=new A.bv("NumberField",null,"A number is typed in a box sized for it (CivicTextField with widthInCharacters and the number keyboard): a stepper's small buttons are slow and easy to miss")
B.Qp=new A.bv("CarouselView",null,"A carousel hides all but one of its items and moves on its own: Civic lists them (CivicListRow)")
B.Qq=new A.bv("Kbd",null,"A public service teaches no shortcuts: every page works with Tab and Enter alone, so there are no keys to show")
B.Qr=new A.bv("MenuBar",null,"A public service has no menus: its places are its navigation (CivicNavigationBar, CivicSideNavigation), its acts are buttons")
B.Qs=new A.bv("DateRangePicker",null,"A range of dates is two date inputs, from and to (CivicDateInput), each typed as the reader knows it")
B.Qt=new A.bv("StepProgress",null,'A public service says where the reader is in words over the question (CivicPageBody\'s caption, "Step 2 of 3") and lists what is left as a task list (CivicListRow with CivicTag): a progress bar promises an end the answers can move')
B.Qu=new A.bv("TreeView",null,"A public service is shallow: a place below another is a page with breadcrumbs (CivicBreadcrumbs), not a branch to open")
B.Qv=new A.bv("Sparkline",null,u.y)
B.Qw=new A.bv("ToggleGroup",null,"A public service asks for one answer of several with radios (CivicRadioGroup), whose every answer is labelled in words, and for several with checkboxes (CivicCheckbox)")
B.Qx=new A.bv("AreaChart",null,u.y)
B.Qy=new A.bv("SplitButton",null,u.A)
B.Qz=new A.bv("Popover",null,u.p)
B.QA=new A.bv("Skeleton",null,"A skeleton shows the shape of nothing to a reader who cannot see it and is silent to one who uses a screen reader: Civic's pages load whole")
B.QB=new A.bv("ReorderableListView",null,'An order of preference is asked as a question per place ("First choice", CivicSelect): dragging rows is hard by the keys and by a screen reader')
B.QC=new A.bv("Meter",null,'An amount against a limit is said in words ("\u20ac60 of \u20ac120"): a gauge says less to fewer people')
B.QD=new A.bv("RefreshIndicator",null,"A service's page says when it was true and offers Try again (CivicEmptyState with a CivicButton): a pull is a gesture some readers cannot make and none can see")
B.QE=new A.bv("InputOtp",null,"A code is typed in one box (CivicTextField with the number keyboard): boxes that jump the caret between them confuse a screen reader and break a paste")
B.QF=new A.bv("BarChart",null,u.y)
B.QG=new A.bv("Badge",null,'A count is said in words beside what it counts ("3 applications"): a number in a dot says nothing of what it counts')
