uage:89,Accessibility:90,"Larger text":91,Reminders:92,"Text size":93,"Makes the words on every page bigger.":94,Appearance:95,Light:96,Dark:97,"Match this device":98,"Renewal reminders":99,[u.r]:100,"Save settings":101,"Your settings have been saved":102,Success:103,"Zone\xa0B: Harbourside":104,January:105,February:106,March:107,April:108,May:109,June:110,July:111,August:112,September:113,October:114,November:115,December:116,Completed:117,"In progress":118,"Not yet started":119,"Cannot start yet":120,"You have completed 1 of 3 tasks.":121,"1. Prepare your application":122,"2. Apply":123,"What kind of vehicle the permit is for":124,"Your name, address and proof of address":125,"Check and send":126,"Check your answers, then send them to us":127,"Not sure of your zone?":128,"Takes around 10 minutes":129,"\u20ac60 a year":130,"A motorcycle permit costs \u20ac30.":131,"You will need":132,"Your address and date of birth":133,"Proof of your address":134,"Such as a tenancy agreement":135,"Find your permit zone":136,Reference:137,Sent:138,Documents:139,History:140,Open:141,"What you can do":142,"Your permit application":143,"We have sent you a link to withdraw it.":144,"Withdraw this application?":145,[u._]:146,"Withdraw application":147,"Keep it":148,"Contact the parking team":149,"Proof of address checked":150,"Application received":151,"Permit approved":152,"Application refused":153,[u.C]:154,"We will decide within 5 working days.":155,"Your visitor permits are ready to use.":156,[u.Q]:157,"3 November 2026":158,"5 November 2026":159,"12 October 2026":160,"14 October 2026":161,"2 September 2026":162,"9 September 2026":163,"You have no applications yet":164,[u.n]:165,"Clear filters":166,"Tick statuses to narrow the list.":167,"Tick zones to narrow the list.":168,"Filter by status":169,"Filter by zone":170,"Apply for a permit":171,[u.h]:172,[u.H]:173,"Choose a file that proves your address":174,[u.G]:175,[u.k]:176,"Search for a street":177,"For example, Ropewalk\xa0Row":17